# text_en = Even your wedded wife, if you fight, if she is angry at you, or you are angry at her, if you remove her belongings from your house, you throw them outside, you chase her away, you tell her to take her belongings, to go away, you don't love her and you are no longer married, she won't be able to leave, but she will just keep crying.
